{"app":"loom","data":true}
target loom, resume
 1 unroute: take the app's routes off the edge; reviewed revisions r1, identity 10517f7162e8092783f2774498063e69a93d1047ad54c80ab16537e4e2aed446
 2 dns: remove the DNS records helios keeps for the app (none)
 3 containers: stop and remove the app's containers and images
 4 data: remove the app's volumes, database and object store: bedrock-loom-core-data, bedrock-loom-objects, bedrock-loom-postgres (no way back except a backup; its backups in the storage bucket stay)
 5 forget: remove the app's network and forget it, and its sealed secrets (only a machine backup made before now, helios backup helios, keeps them)
